WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[Tersedia subtitle Bahasa Indonesia]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 25]

01:43.000 --> 01:44.000
Berapa harganya?

