03:57.620 --> 03:58.260
Luo Ge.

04:01.740 --> 04:02.580
Luo Ge?

04:05.670 --> 04:08.250
♫ Suara alat musik sheng menyambut musim semi ♫

04:07.060 --> 04:08.920
