Usir mereka semua.

09:16.420 --> 09:16.890
Baik.

09:22.390 --> 09:22.940
Cepat.

09:23.100 --> 09:23.500
Cepat.

09:38.330 --> 09:38.900
Liu Shao.

09:43.980 --> 09:45.380
