13:41.100 --> 13:42.830
hanya bisa memohon bantuanmu.

13:51.220 --> 13:51.740
Maaf.

13:54.220 --> 13:54.980
Liu Shao!

13:55.780 --> 13:56.570
Liu Shao!

14:03.220 --> 14:04.340
Liu Shao!

14:06.140 --> 14:07.460
Liu Shao!

14:08.820 --> 14:10.140
Kamu pergi ke mana?

14:15.290 --> 14:16.620
Penguasa Istana Shang.

14:17.260 --> 14:17.980
Mohon kamu

14:19.220 --> 14:21.350
memberi sihir peredam suara untukku.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.650
Aku takut aku akan

14:23.220 --> 14:24.620
